\section{Binary Layout Optimization (BOLT)}\label{sec:bolt}

\emph{BOLT} (Binary Optimization and Layout Tool) performs post-link optimization of code layout:

\begin{definition}[BOLT Optimization]\label{def:bolt}
\textbf{BOLT} disassembles a binary, analyzes its control flow using profile data, and re-layouts the code for better performance. Key optimizations:
\begin{itemize}
  \item Basic block reordering (Pettis-Hansen)
  \item Hot/cold splitting
  \item Inline small functions at call sites
  \item Jump table optimization
  \item Branch relaxation and shortening
\end{itemize}
\end{definition}

